Z||000000||David DeVoe||12-07-2001||09:18 AM||||Did a search in the archive for head gasket info, not much there. I need ideas on the best head gaskets for the 2.8. I've done some shopping and am surprised by the wide variation in prices. Going on the assumption that sometimes you get what you pay for I don't want the cheapest. I'm leaning toward Felpro but they seem to have different grades and widely varying prices. What do you guys think??<BR>Dave||||reg||1
Z||000001||Formula||12-07-2001||11:42 AM||||I'l sell you a set of brand new felpro ones that I bought for my performance 2.8 rebuild  for half the price of the new ones. (I dont need them because I went 3.4 crate performance and they are just taking up space).<p>[This message has been edited by Formula (edited 12-07-2001).]||||reg||1
Z||000002||1FST2M6||12-07-2001||01:58 PM|||| <A HREF="http://www.paeco.com" TARGET=_blank>www.paeco.com</A>  will make you dead soft copper ones for $60 each. what are you planing on doing? high boost, or direct port fogger you'll need a better gasket. n/a.. i'd hook up with Formula||||reg||1
Z||000003||2birds||12-07-2001||04:33 PM||||You don't need anything more than good quality unless you are doing something REALLY special.  That means Fel-Pro to me.  A plain old OEM replacement set from Fel-Pro is all you need.  A complete set (includes all the intake and exhaust stuff too) was around $90 at Advance Auto.  Individual head gaskets were $10 or $15 each there.  Don't forget to replace the head bolts, too, since they are only supposed to be used once.  Advance wanted about $40 for both heads (Fel-Pro's bolt set), but they price-matched against Discount Auto (Motormite bolt set) down to $22.  I obviously went with the Fel-Pro's.  Definitely pays to shop around.    ||||reg||1
Z||000004||jimmybpei||12-07-2001||04:37 PM||||I'm running with the fel pro cooper ring gasket which are about 50.00 each Canadain $ that is. Kindda pricy but dont feel like pulling the top end off again for a few dollars.<P>Just my input.<P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/jimmybpeisig_1.gif"> ||||reg||1
